repository-code: "https://github.com/upunaprosk/hate-prototypes"

url: "https://github.com/upunaprosk/hate-prototypes"

abstract: >-
  Code and resources for HatePrototypes: Interpretable and Transferable
  Representations for Implicit and Explicit Hate Speech Detection.
  The repository contains implementations for prototype-based hate speech
  classification, cross-dataset transfer, guard-model evaluation, and
  early-exit experiments.

keywords:
  - "hate speech detection"
  - "natural language processing"
  - "prototypes"
  - "transfer learning"
  - "early exiting"
  - "content moderation"

